# modemmenu.users - user:password, one per line (mode 0600)
#
#   modemmenu -hash          prints the bcrypt hash of a password
#
# user:!hash is locked (signup's pending accounts): remove the ! to unlock.
# What follows a second : is a note (signup writes its date and caller ID).
#
# guest:{PLAIN}guest
# alice:$2a$10$...
